      <p>A weeknight-cook's ode to the family member who always eats her experiments first — a quick, plated open toast that feels like a recipe passed across a kitchen counter, not a demo. The role of this film in the line-up is <strong>accessibility</strong>: a recipe a viewer can attempt the next morning, with Borges' extra-virgin olive oil drizzled in exactly when the reel asks them to. <em>Low-barrier participation is how the hashtag spreads.</em></p>
