      <p>Awards do half the work. Talent activation does the other half. We engineered a moment where <strong>Ishant Sharma gave the YYC brands a shoutout on a Delhi Capitals podcast</strong> — earned media inside cricket-fan attention, the highest-trust channel for the audience the group's premium positioning was after.</p>
